878
01:04:30,040 --> 01:04:31,920
That's my condition--
my necessary condition

879
01:04:31,920 --> 01:04:32,953
for optimality.

880
01:04:40,350 --> 01:04:45,780
If partial h, partial
p is 0, then I

881
01:04:45,780 --> 01:04:48,760
