895
01:06:04,400 --> 01:06:09,230
We're going to look at
this partial h, partial x--

896
01:06:09,230 --> 01:06:12,140
the variations-- but
first, integrate by parts.

897
01:06:30,890 --> 01:06:39,260
The integral of my p of
t x dot t dt from 0 to t

