913
01:08:43,430 --> 01:08:50,420
OK, so Pontryagin's minimum
principle says that,

914
01:08:50,420 --> 01:08:54,290
if my constraint is
satisfied to x dot,

915
01:08:54,290 --> 01:08:59,600
and if I can just integrate back
